                             reducing them immediately to their                 
                             popcount (since further steps only                 
                             depend on that):\\n\\n```python\\ndef              
                             count_k_reducible(s: str, k: int) ->               
                             int:\\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\\n    n =               
                             int(s, 2)\\n    m = n - 1\\n    if m <=            
