                             cnt_m = count_popcount_up_to(m, b)\\n              
                             cnt_800 = count_popcount_up_to(800,                
                             b)\\n                total_B += (cnt_m             
                             - cnt_800)\\n    return (total +                   
                             total_B) % MOD\\n```\\n\\nBut this is              
                             still too complex, and the original                
                             reference implementation in C would                
                             have used the direct simulation for all            
                             numbers up to n-1 but with                         
                             optimizations for the small steps.                 
                             Since the problem allows us to wrap the            
